                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> Would you accept a PR with this change?\r\n\r\nAdding `opts.color` itself looks reasonable, not sure about this particular way of making it work, though. As ANSI codes can (in theory) be used for something else beside the color.\r\n\r\nMaybe it is better to ahve `opts.use_ansi_codes`. I'll think about it.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Would you accept a PR with this change?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adding <code class=\"notranslate\">opts.color</code> itself looks reasonable, not sure about this particular way of making it work, though. As ANSI codes can (in theory) be used for something else beside the color.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Maybe it is better to ahve <code class=\"notranslate\">opts.use_ansi_codes</code>. I'll think about it.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Would you accept a PR with this change?\n\nAdding opts.color itself looks reasonable, not sure about this particular way of making it work, though. As ANSI codes can (in theory) be used for something else beside the color.\nMaybe it is better to ahve opts.use_ansi_codes. I'll think about it.",
